<div class="rd-manifesto-page">

    <div class="rd-manifesto-intro" style="background-image: url('{{ pathPrefix }}/images/somewhere-like-warrington.png')">
        <div class="rd-manifesto-intro-inner">
            <h1>The <em>Redirected</em> Manifesto</h1>
            <p class="rd-manifesto-intro-lead">A complete alternative to the UK's tax system: much simpler, revenue-neutral, and designed to reward creation more than extraction. Select any measure to see the detail.</p>
            <p class="rd-manifesto-tagline">Money back in your pocket. Green choices rewarded. Wealth pays more.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PEOPLE -->
    <div class="rd-manifesto-theme">
        <div class="rd-manifesto-theme-inner">
            <div class="rd-theme-header rd-theme-header--people">
                <span class="rd-theme-label">Theme one</span>
                <h2 class="rd-theme-title">People</h2>
            </div>

            <p class="rd-theme-intro">Our current system taxes work more than wealth. We need to fix the incentives at the root: cutting taxes for workers and business, making all income equal before the law and building strong communities with good housing accessible to all.</p>

            <div class="rd-mosaic">

                <a href="{{ pathPrefix }}/redirected/measures/abolish-national-insurance/" class="rd-tile rd-tile--dark rd-tile--wide rd-tile--tall">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">People</span>
                    <span class="rd-tile-big-number">£200bn</span>
                    <p class="rd-tile-big-number-label">taken off the cost of employing people</p>
                    <h3 class="rd-tile-title">Abolish National Insurance</h3>
                    <p class="rd-tile-hook">The biggest tax cut for workers in a generation. Every pound of it paid for without cutting services.</p>
                    <span class="rd-tile-arrow">→</span>
                </a>

                <a href="{{ pathPrefix }}/redirected/measures/housing-revolution/" class="rd-tile rd-tile--yellow">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">People</span>
                    <h3 class="rd-tile-title">Housing Revolution</h3>
                    <p class="rd-tile-hook">Land banking penalised. Council tax abolished. A Land Value Tax that makes building cheaper than speculating.</p>
                    <span class="rd-tile-arrow">→</span>
                </a>

                <div class="rd-tile rd-tile--image" style="background-image: url('{{ pathPrefix }}/images/young-worker.png')">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">People</span>
                    <span class="rd-tile-big-number">+£6–8k</span>
                    <p class="rd-tile-big-number-label">per year for a typical young worker</p>
                </div>

                <a href="{{ pathPrefix }}/redirected/measures/wealth-tax/" class="rd-tile rd-tile--light">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">People</span>
                    <h3 class="rd-tile-title">Annual Wealth Tax</h3>
                    <p class="rd-tile-hook">A progressive annual tax starting at 0.8% on net wealth above £100k. Half of households pay nothing.</p>
                    <span class="rd-tile-arrow">→</span>
                </a>

                <a href="{{ pathPrefix }}/redirected/measures/income-tax-reform/" class="rd-tile rd-tile--yellow">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">People</span>
                    <h3 class="rd-tile-title">Unified Income Tax</h3>
                    <p class="rd-tile-hook">Dividends and capital gains taxed at the same rates as wages. Dozens of complicated tax rules abolished.</p>
                    <span class="rd-tile-arrow">→</span>
                </a>

                <a href="{{ pathPrefix }}/redirected/measures/youth-prospects/" class="rd-tile rd-tile--dark">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">People</span>
                    <h3 class="rd-tile-title">Empower Young Workers</h3>
                    <p class="rd-tile-hook">The first £25k is tax-free. Around 1m new jobs. An accessible housing market.</p>
                    <span class="rd-tile-arrow">→</span>
                </a>

                <a href="{{ pathPrefix }}/redirected/measures/restoring-communities/" class="rd-tile rd-tile--green">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">People</span>
                    <h3 class="rd-tile-title">Restoring Communities</h3>
                    <p class="rd-tile-hook">A high street renaissance, better land use and dependency on cars gradually engineered out.</p>
                    <span class="rd-tile-arrow">→</span>
                </a>

                <div class="rd-tile rd-tile--image" style="background-image: url('{{ pathPrefix }}/images/georgian-houses.png')">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">People</span>
                    <p class="rd-tile-hook" style="margin-top: auto;">Wealth pays its share.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="rd-tile rd-tile--image" style="background-image: url('{{ pathPrefix }}/images/somewhere-like-warrington.png')">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">People</span>
                    <p class="rd-tile-hook" style="margin-top: auto;">Communities that flourish.</p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PLANET -->
    <div class="rd-manifesto-theme">
        <div class="rd-manifesto-theme-inner">
            <div class="rd-theme-header rd-theme-header--planet">
                <span class="rd-theme-label">Theme two</span>
                <h2 class="rd-theme-title">Planet</h2>
            </div>

            <p class="rd-theme-intro">Britain knows what needs to be done and has the technology. We need a transition package that makes switching the obvious decision rather than the difficult one. Government can't fix the climate on its own. We need to make a pact with people so that they benefit directly and financially from the green change we deliver together.</p>

            <div class="rd-mosaic">

                <a href="{{ pathPrefix }}/redirected/measures/carbon-tax/" class="rd-tile rd-tile--dark rd-tile--wide">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">Planet</span>
                    <h3 class="rd-tile-title">Carbon Tax</h3>
                    <p class="rd-tile-hook">Comprehensive carbon pricing across the whole economy. A price signal: greener choices save money and become obvious. Unlocking the energy transition without mandates or moralising.</p>
                    <span class="rd-tile-arrow">→</span>
                </a>

                <div class="rd-tile rd-tile--image rd-tile--tall" style="background-image: url('{{ pathPrefix }}/images/heatpump.png')">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">Planet</span>
                    <span class="rd-tile-big-number">22%</span>
                    <p class="rd-tile-big-number-label">emissions reduction by 2030</p>
                    <span class="rd-tile-big-number" style="font-size: clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.8rem);">3.5m</span>
                    <p class="rd-tile-big-number-label">heat pumps installed by 2030</p>
                </div>

                <a href="{{ pathPrefix }}/redirected/measures/circular-economy/" class="rd-tile rd-tile--yellow rd-tile--wide">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">Planet</span>
                    <h3 class="rd-tile-title">VAT for the Planet</h3>
                    <p class="rd-tile-hook">40% VAT on single-use plastic. 30% on new gas boilers and petrol cars. 0% on repairs.  Reverse VAT on circular packaging. Prices that reflect environmental cost and reward better use of materials.</p>
                    <span class="rd-tile-arrow">→</span>
                </a>

                <a href="{{ pathPrefix }}/redirected/measures/energy-transition/" class="rd-tile rd-tile--light">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">Planet</span>
                    <h3 class="rd-tile-title">The Energy Transition</h3>
                    <p class="rd-tile-hook">Heat pumps at £15k grant. EVs and solar at 0% VAT. Fuel Duty replaced with Carbon Tax.  Dynamic pricing for electricity. £8bn in public transport.</p>
                    <span class="rd-tile-arrow">→</span>
                </a>

                <a href="{{ pathPrefix }}/redirected/measures/road-pricing/" class="rd-tile rd-tile--dark">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">Planet</span>
                    <h3 class="rd-tile-title">Road Pricing</h3>
                    <p class="rd-tile-hook">GPS-based distance charging replaces VED. 2p/mile for EVs, 7p for petrol. Rural drivers pay less. City-centre peak commuters pay more.</p>
                    <span class="rd-tile-arrow">→</span>
                </a>

                <div class="rd-tile rd-tile--image" style="background-image: url('{{ pathPrefix }}/images/petrol-station.png')">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">Planet</span>
                    <p class="rd-tile-hook" style="margin-top: auto;">Carbon priced honestly.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="rd-tile rd-tile--image" style="background-image: url('{{ pathPrefix }}/images/motorway.png')">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">Planet</span>
                    <p class="rd-tile-hook" style="margin-top: auto;">Fair costs for drivers.</p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PROFIT -->
    <div class="rd-manifesto-theme">
        <div class="rd-manifesto-theme-inner">
            <div class="rd-theme-header rd-theme-header--profit">
                <span class="rd-theme-label">Theme three</span>
                <h2 class="rd-theme-title">Profit & Growth</h2>
            </div>

            <p class="rd-theme-intro">All of it amounts to nothing without the right kind of growth. Creating value, employing people, life getting better each year. This is what a good economy looks like. These measures remove the friction: costs down, taxes down, and a structure that rewards businesses for hiring and building — not for hoarding land or sheltering income.</p>

            <div class="rd-mosaic">

                <a href="{{ pathPrefix }}/redirected/measures/abolish-business-rates/" class="rd-tile rd-tile--yellow rd-tile--wide">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">Profit</span>
                    <h3 class="rd-tile-title">Abolish Business Rates</h3>
                    <p class="rd-tile-hook">£26bn wiped off the cost of occupying premises. Replaced by a Land Value Tax that taxes the land, not the business built on it.</p>
                    <span class="rd-tile-arrow">→</span>
                </a>

                <a href="{{ pathPrefix }}/redirected/measures/corporation-tax/" class="rd-tile rd-tile--dark">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">Profit</span>
                    <h3 class="rd-tile-title">Cut Corporation Tax to 20%</h3>
                    <p class="rd-tile-hook">Down from 25%. Competitive with Germany. Boosting inward investment and rewarding growth.</p>
                    <span class="rd-tile-arrow">→</span>
                </a>

                <a href="{{ pathPrefix }}/redirected/measures/best-place-to-employ/" class="rd-tile rd-tile--green rd-tile--wide">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">Profit</span>
                    <h3 class="rd-tile-title">The Best Place in the World to Employ People</h3>
                    <p class="rd-tile-hook">No employer's NI. Low corporation tax. Every pound saved on employment costs makes it easier to hire.</p>
                    <span class="rd-tile-arrow">→</span>
                </a>

                <div class="rd-tile rd-tile--image" style="background-image: url('{{ pathPrefix }}/images/workshop.png')">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">Profit</span>
                    <span class="rd-tile-big-number" style="font-size: clamp(2rem,5vw,3rem);">£4,500</span>
                    <p class="rd-tile-big-number-label">saved per £30k employee, per year</p>
                </div>

                <div class="rd-tile rd-tile--image" style="background-image: url('{{ pathPrefix }}/images/high-street.png')">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">Profit</span>
                    <p class="rd-tile-hook" style="margin-top: auto;">Town centres that can compete.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="rd-tile rd-tile--image" style="background-image: url('{{ pathPrefix }}/images/industrial-estate.png')">
                    <span class="rd-tile-tag">Profit</span>
                    <p class="rd-tile-hook" style="margin-top: auto;">Enterprise rewarded over extraction.</p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

